artifacts:
  - $route/4.1.scenario.elimination.assay.enumerate.yield.md

reviews:
  self:
    - slug: has-test-per-live-scenario
      say: |
        does every live scenario have a named test to rule it out — or an
        explicit flag that none exists? a live scenario with no test and no flag
        is an un-tracked landmine.
    - slug: has-catastrophic-coverage
      say: |
        for each live CATASTROPHIC scenario, is the test that rules it out named?
        this is the test that lifts a treatment veto — it cannot be absent
        silently.
